>\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> When was the <strong>JSSC Excise Constable JECCE 2023 Answer Key</strong>\u00a0released?</span></span></li>\n<li><strong style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\">Answer:</strong><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; font-family: inherit;\"> The Answer Key has released recently on the official<strong> JSSC website.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> How can I check my <strong>Answer Key?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> You can check it by entering your <strong data-end=\"444\" data-start=\"407\">Registration Number / Roll Number</strong> and <strong data-end=\"466\" data-start=\"449\">Date of Birth</strong> on the answer key portal.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> What details are mentioned in the <strong>Answer Key?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Your <strong data-end=\"610\" data-start=\"595\">roll number</strong>, and <strong data-end=\"650\" data-start=\"616\">other exam-related information</strong> will be shown.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the next step <strong>after qualifying the PET?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: Candidates who qualify will be called for the Document Verification (DV) round.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>Jharkhand Staff Selection Commission JSSC</strong></span><strong>?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>JSSC</strong></span><strong>\u00a0</strong>is: <strong>http://jssc.nic.in/whats-new</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"JSSC Excise Constable JECCE 2023 Answer Key\" class=\"size-large wp-image-33683 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-45-1024x576.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-45-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-45-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-45-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Official-Sarkari-Result-Since-2009-45.jpg 1200w\" width=\"1024\"/></p>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"><span class=\"gb-headline-text\">Sarkari Res